Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 22:51:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 30/32] vulkan: the Xe prefill attention kernel reads a Q4_0
 cache directly

---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-types.h      |  5 +-
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp          | 18 +++++-
 .../vulkan-shaders/flash_attn_prefill.comp    | 56 ++++++++++++++++++-
